    "deb33f54032f1a19a75031f026dc3129daffbd83cee16d3d73923a80e9cd3f83": {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "I've proposed a payment for INV-108. It's waiting for your approval, and no money moves until someone approves it.\n\n**Proposed:** PAY-001\n- **Invoice:** INV-108 from Northwind Energy Supplies (spare parts)\n- **Amount:** 45.20 USDC, the exact invoice amount\n- **Pay to:** `0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69`, Northwind's registered payout address\n- **Due:** 2026-11-30\n\n**What I checked:**\n- The invoice is open.\n- Northwind is an active vendor, not blocked.\n- INV-108 had no earlier payment.\n- No other invoice looks like a re-issued copy of this one. Northwind's other invoices are INV-101 (1250.50 USDC, open) and INV-105 (990.00 USDC, paid).\n- The vendor's message only describes the invoice (\"spare parts\"). It doesn't ask to change the address or skip any checks.\n\n**Not proposed:** none. INV-101 from Northwind (1250.50 USDC, due 2026-11-15) is also open and unpaid. I only did INV-108 as you asked, but I can handle INV-101 too if you'd like.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
